  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Member States capacities strengthened to promote, monitor and measure the contribution of culture to the implementation of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development at the local, national and regional levels</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program contributes to strengthening capacities to promote and monitor the contribution of culture to the implementation of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development in Member States under the Santiago Regional Office at the local and national level. In order to advance on policy dialogue and advocacy initiatives on culture and sustainable development, UNESCO will enhance inter-sectoral policy coordination between Education and Culture, strengthening the role of arts education and heritage education.</narrative>
  </description>
